claire: Thanks, I'll fix the anchor and add a redirect note for older permalinks.

ben: Also mention proxy/CDN header rewriting as a troubleshooting bullet: if Retry-After missing, check for X-Rate-Limit-Reset or x-retry-after-ms variants.

claire: Added header variants and a small curl one-liner for debugging raw headers.

